WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:02,900
Can't see in from outside

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,180
The view inside is not affected

3
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:05,740
This way you can collect things in the space later

4
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:07,180
Not afraid of being seen by the building opposite

5
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,540
It's so hot

6
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:13,540
The water level of the Susi River dropped by at least one meter

7
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:16,980
This is what the previous view looked like

8
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,900
Drought for several months

9
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,580
It didn’t finally rain until the end of July

10
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:22,820
It's raining. It's finally raining.

11
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,820
But that rain lasted for a month

12
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:27,300
Farmland flooded, food harvest failed

13
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,100
City power outage and water outage

14
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,780
Only then did everyone understand

15
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,500
That's not life-saving rain

16
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:34,590
There are only more than twenty days left

17
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,620
so many stars

18
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:43,670
Beautiful?

19
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:45,350
It doesn’t matter if you can’t understand it now

20
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:46,950
Mom will record it for you first

21
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:48,110
When you grow up

22
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:49,350
Let's watch it together again

23
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:52,210
Is this our home?
